    "report_markdown": "# Hypora run report: run_1247ee1f9cd8\n\n**Outcome:** a verified model.\n\n## Task\n- Objective: Predict the total UPDRS score of a Parkinson's patient from voice recordings made at home. The model will be used on patients it has not seen.\n- Target: `total_UPDRS` (regression)\n- Primary metric: `mae` (minimize)\n\n_No narrative: the fixed-pipeline baseline makes no model calls._\n\n## Final model\n- Trial `trl_849daebe`: Default HistGradientBoosting on every column with a random split.\n- Verified: yes\n\n| Metric | Test (once) | Validation (mean) |\n|---|---|---|\n| mae | 0.3945 | 0.4859 |\n| rmse | 0.6217 | 0.7379 |\n| r2 | 0.9970 | 0.9955 |\n\n| Check | Status | Detail |\n|---|---|---|\n| allowed_features | passed | trial code received exactly the contract's allowed features |\n| split_respected | passed | random split: disjoint, complete |\n| test_labels_not_accessed | passed | every predict stage saw features and the model only |\n| output_shape | passed | one prediction per planned row, task-shaped columns |\n| finite_outputs | passed | all predictions finite and well-formed |\n| metric_recomputation | passed | recomputed metrics match the harness |\n| artifact_loads | passed | the frozen model loaded in a sandbox and predicted the test split |\n| resource_limits | passed | every stage completed inside the submitted job's limits |\n| learned_transform_leakage | skipped | static analysis of fit/predict arrives with verifier v2 (S3.C4) |\n\n## Trials\n| Trial | Kind | Status | Validation mae (mean \u00b1 std, folds) | Hypothesis |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `trl_849daebe` | baseline | verified | 0.4859 \u00b1 0.0060 (3) | Default HistGradientBoosting on every column with a random split. |\n\n## Data\n- Split: random, 20% test, kfold_3\n- Features used: 20; excluded: none\n- Leakage screen: Leakage candidates flagged: 2 among 20 screened features; methodological review is required.\n\n## Decision and faults\n- Decision: train (approved_plan)\n\n## Run notes\n- Fixed-pipeline baseline (spec \u00a719.3): random split, every column but the forbidden ones, default HistGradientBoosting, one trial. Contract built by code, plan approved by policy.\n- Final candidate trl_849daebe: best mean validation mae.\n- Final job job_1794149942832432040_db7e27: test split scored once; verifier v1 passed.\n\n## Sources\n- `task_spec:run_1247ee1f9cd8.v1`\n- `profile:run_1247ee1f9cd8.profile.7ab08025cb89`\n- `experiment_contract:run_1247ee1f9cd8.v1`\n- `result:trl_849daebe/test`\n"
